    {
      "id": "8d51T6rLcGHuPY60vk5Hp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1985.3128437873697,
      "y": 769.8596915746987,
      "width": 1153.800048828125,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 777125676,
      "version": 719,
      "versionNonce": 125449451,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773218880759,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "假设这个规则包里有N条规则，最后是1、3、N这3条规则命中了\n而验证策略的优先级(已经以数字形式配置)是：策略1 < 策略n < 策略2\n\n规则包最后只会有一个生效的验证策略，就是策略2",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "假设这个规则包里有N条规则，最后是1、3、N这3条规则命中了\n而验证策略的优先级(已经以数字形式配置)是：策略1 < 策略n < 策略2\n\n规则包最后只会有一个生效的验证策略，就是策略2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
